w+4:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3w}{w+4}-\\frac{6}{1} & = \\\\ \\frac{3w}{w+4}-\\frac{w+4}{w+4}\\cdot \\frac{6}{1} & = \\\\ \\frac{3w}{w+4}-\\frac{6(w+4)}{w+4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we subtract the fractions and simplify the result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3w}{w+4}-\\frac{6(w+4)}{w+4} & = \\\\ \\frac{3w-6(w+4)}{w+4} & = \\\\ \\frac{3w-6w-24}{w+4} & = \\\\ \\frac{-3w-24}{w+4} & = \\\\ -\\frac{3(w+8)}{w+4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533631 true] [17592186242872 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242873 13194139533631 true] [17592186242872 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242874 13194139533631 true] [17592186242872 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242875 13194139533631 true] [17592186242872 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242876 13194139533631 true] [17592186242872 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242877 13194139533631 true] [17592186242872 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533631 true] [17592186242872 1041 "selection" 13194139533631 true] [17592186242872 1104 #edb/ref 17592186242876 13194139533631 true] [17592186242872 1110 #uuid "6e452f2a-dcba-5730-9761-703baf6d43d8" 13194139533631 true] [17592186242873 1034 "-\\frac{w+8}{w+4}" 13194139533631 true] [17592186242873 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533631 true] [17592186242873 1111 #uuid "df136a3c-0c94-558d-8875-21bb302f26a0" 13194139533631 true] [17592186242874 1034 "\\frac{3(w-4)}{w+4}" 13194139533631 true] [17592186242874 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533631 true] [17592186242874 1111 #uuid "047cf466-15a1-57d1-86a4-70733122e133" 13194139533631 true] [17592186242875 1034 "-\\frac{w+24}{w+4}" 13194139533631 true] [17592186242875 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533631 true] [17592186242875 1111 #uuid "94e3ab92-1f0e-57a3-a793-d52dafe8e1d5" 13194139533631 true] [17592186242876 1034 "-\\frac{3(w+8)}{w+4}" 13194139533631 true] [17592186242876 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533631 true] [17592186242876 1111 #uuid "991076ce-2af0-55f2-bfe6-dc38edd9ed6e" 13194139533631 true] [17592186242877 1034 "-\\frac{3w+10}{w+4}" 13194139533631 true] [